      "text/plain": [
       "    Pipeline  SP -> nRF Slope (傾き)  Intercept (切片)  Correlation (R)  \\\n",
       "0     MSA+ML               -0.4749          0.4105          -0.7072   \n",
       "1         GS               -0.3687          0.3925          -0.6134   \n",
       "2  MSA+RAXML               -0.4773          0.4124          -0.7075   \n",
       "3     PSA+NJ               -0.5786          0.5119          -0.7719   \n",
       "4     MSA+NJ               -0.4512          0.3895          -0.6938   \n",
       "\n",
       "   R^2 (決定係数)    p-value  Extreme Zone (SSS≤0.03) Mean nRF  \\\n",
       "0      0.5001  4.98e-273                            0.3757   \n",
       "1      0.3763  1.49e-186                            0.3836   \n",
       "2      0.5005  2.57e-273                            0.3779   \n",
